  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "76b6f1e6-3f0f-4f06-b80f-9a7b78056899",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "Write down your design pillars. This is the foundation of your game and should never change. Your whole design should tie back to these pillars."
    },
    {
      "id": "387d840f-a89d-4cb5-93a4-c168b4d72a8f",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "d24abc9a-da07-4672-9122-32fd2fd4e72c",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "For example:"
    },
    {
      "id": "a12cb6ce-456a-4d83-b16f-40d321b52467",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "4aca262c-195a-4ce6-87f2-818fbc5ad6d5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "<strong>Intoxicating Creation</strong>"
    },
    {
      "id": "c7a2a64f-98f8-4449-bd7f-611030be77ac",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "The overwhelming excitement of being able to build anything."
    },
    {
      "id": "254823c9-1d75-4ce7-a8db-a1b241a579bd",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "24fbf0a3-211b-4339-8a37-6d45921e5ddf",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "<strong>Thrill of the Unknown</strong>"
    },
    {
      "id": "063f1655-fad8-41f6-924e-ef339ee7ae78",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "Excitement, dread and tension of exploring the unknown. No idea what dangers/rewards are down there."
    },
    {
      "id": "50a676e8-b7a6-4ff7-abc0-9bed2b8af56e",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "62d21bf1-d17b-48f6-926c-39ee8cd23fb8",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "<strong>Cascading Hysteria</strong>"
    },
    {
      "id": "3c7cdc21-3ad3-4451-9317-c0fdbd7d9901",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "Uncontrollable outburst of emotion, fear, irrationality, laughter, weeping, etc. FTL style chain of &quot;oh sh!t&quot; dependencies, where a failure in one system can affect others, until you're suddenly in trouble."
    },
    {
      "id": "181a5f73-c4a8-4299-a601-72a80058b2ae",
